---
import { useT } from "../i18n.js";

const { lang = "ja" } = Astro.props;
const t = useT(lang);
const en = lang === "en";

const floatingTools = [
  {
    src: "/images/ps-tool.png",
    alt: "Photoshop",
    glow: "49,168,255",
    rot: 8,
    size: "clamp(90px,11vw,160px)",
    pos: "top:90px;right:7%;",
  },
  {
    src: "/images/ai-tool.png",
    alt: "Illustrator",
    glow: "255,154,0",
    rot: -12,
    size: "clamp(90px,9vw,150px)",
    pos: "bottom:200px;left:2%;",
  },
  {
    src: "/images/af-tool.png",
    alt: "After Effects",
    glow: "153,102,255",
    rot: 7,
    size: "clamp(70px,8vw,120px)",
    pos: "bottom:60px;left:6%;",
  },
  {
    src: "/images/an-tool.png",
    alt: "Animate",
    glow: "125,90,255",
    rot: -8,
    size: "clamp(80px,9vw,140px)",
    pos: "top:38%;right:2%;",
  },
  {
    src: "/images/xd-tool.png",
    alt: "Adobe XD",
    glow: "255,61,246",
    rot: -5,
    size: "clamp(70px,9vw,130px)",
    pos: "top:120px;left:6%;",
  },
  {
    src: "/images/figma-tool.svg",
    alt: "Figma",
    glow: "162,89,255",
    rot: 10,
    size: "clamp(80px,9vw,140px)",
    pos: "bottom:20px;right:3%;",
    glass: true,
  },
];

const tools = [
  { src: "/images/tools-outline/ps-outline.svg", alt: "Photoshop" },
  { src: "/images/tools-outline/ai-outline.svg", alt: "Illustrator" },
  { src: "/images/tools-outline/ae-outline.svg", alt: "After Effects" },
  { src: "/images/tools-outline/an-outline.svg", alt: "Animate" },
  { src: "/images/tools-outline/xd-outline.svg", alt: "Adobe XD" },
  { src: "/images/tools-outline/figma-outline.svg", alt: "Figma" },
];
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  {
    floatingTools.map((tool) => (
      <div
        class={`tool-icon${tool.glass ? " tool-icon--glass" : ""}`}
        style={`position:absolute;${tool.pos}--glow:${tool.glow};--rot:${tool.rot}deg;z-index:1;`}
      >
        <img src={tool.src} alt={tool.alt} style={`width:${tool.size};height:${tool.size};`} />
      </div>
    ))
  }
  <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <div class="eyebrow">About Me</div>
    <h2 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,46px);font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);">
      {
        en ? (
          <Fragment>Born in Hong Kong, based in Japan —<br />a multilingual UI/UX designer</Fragment>
        ) : (
          <Fragment><span style="display:inline-block;">香港生まれ、</span><span style="display:inline-block;">日本在住の</span><br /><span style="display:inline-block;"><span style="display:inline-block;">マルチリンガル</span><span style="display:inline-block;">UI/UXデザイナー</span></span></Fragment>
        )
      }
    </h2>

    <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:48px;column-gap:72px;">
      <div class="about-card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-soft);">
        <p style="margin:0;">
          {t(
            "香港出身。2015年にワーキングホリデーで来日し、現在は日本国籍を取得。広東語（母語）、日本語、英語、中国語を操るマルチリンガルです。香港で約2年間のWebデザイナー経験を経て、現在は関西を拠点に東京の企業へフルリモート勤務しています。",
            "I’m from Hong Kong. I came to Japan on a working holiday visa in 2015 and have since become a Japanese citizen. I speak Cantonese (native), Japanese, English and Mandarin Chinese. After about two years as a web designer in Hong Kong, I now live in the Kansai region and work fully remotely for a company in Tokyo.",
          )}
        </p>
        <p style="margin:0;">
          {t(
            "Web・アプリのメインUI/UXデザイナーとして約13年のキャリアを持ち、特に多言語展開や大規模WEBサイトのデザイン・構築に強みがあります。前職の株式会社ミツエーリンクスでは約7年間、大手企業の日本国内およびグローバルサイトのUI/UX改善や多言語対応を担当し、CV率や売上向上に貢献しました。",
            "I have about 13 years of experience as a lead UI/UX designer for websites and apps, with particular strength in multilingual rollouts and the design and build of large-scale websites. At my previous company, Mitsue-Links Co., Ltd., I spent about seven years improving the UI/UX of major corporations’ Japanese and global websites and handling their localization, helping raise conversion rates and sales.",
          )}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-soft);">
        <p style="margin:0;">
          {t(
            "現職のミライズエネチェンジ株式会社では、自社サービスの各種イベントサイト制作をはじめ、新規事業「EV PLUS」の立ち上げにおけるアートディレクション（ビジュアル方針の策定）や、アプリのUIUXデザインおよび継続的な改善まで、メインデザイナーとして幅広く携わっています。",
            "At my current company, MIRAIZ ENECHANGE Co., Ltd., I work as the lead designer across a wide range of projects: event and campaign sites for our services, art direction (setting the visual direction) for the launch of the new business “EV PLUS”, and the UI/UX design and ongoing improvement of our app.",
          )}
        </p>
        <p style="margin:0;">
          {t(
            "画面デザインにとどまらず、ビジュアルの方向性策定やチームマネジメント、改善提案まで柔軟に対応できる点、そして多文化理解に基づいた国際的な視点が強みです。",
            "My strengths go beyond screen design: I’m comfortable setting visual direction, managing a team and proposing improvements, and I bring an international perspective grounded in an understanding of many cultures.",
          )}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:56px;">
      TOOLS I USE
    </div>
    <div class="tools-row">
      {
        tools.map((tool) => (
          <div class="tool-box">
            <img src={tool.src} alt={tool.alt} />
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
